   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hello everyone, <div><br></div><div>Last days I tried to work with Poppr again. but I had some problem regarding loading  adegenet package.</div><div><br></div><div>I got this message:</div><div><br></div><div>Loading required package: ade4<br>Error: package or namespace load failed for ‘adegenet’ in loadNamespace(i, c(lib.loc, .libPaths()), versionCheck = vI[[i]]):<br> namespace ‘htmltools’ 0.5.3 is being loaded, but &gt;= 0.5.4 is required<br></div><div><br></div><div>I have read about the problem or similar issues, but nothing helped to solve it . </div><div><br></div><div>I will appreciate any help.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks a lot </div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "IS4QiSz8BQAJ",
   "from": "Julius Pyton Sserumaga",
   "author": "8b4dc93f931f011e",
